cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use vibe-queue in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "vibe-queue: a job scheduler for quantum-chemistry calculations"
abstract: >
  vibe-queue (command vq) submits, tracks and fetches quantum-chemistry
  jobs across workstations and HPC schedulers, with per-commit runtime
  pinning so a calculation records the exact source it ran against. It
  drives vibe-qc out of process and never imports it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Peintinger
    given-names: Michael F.
    website: "https://vibe-qc.com/"
version: 0.26.9
date-released: 2026-09-17
url: "https://vibe-qc.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vibe-qc/vibe-queue"
license: MPL-2.0
keywords:
  - job scheduler
  - high-performance computing
  - quantum chemistry
